                            <figure class="post-image">
                                        
                    <img src="https://image.dunya.com/rcman/Cw1280h720q95gc/storage/files/images/2026/02/21/ozgur-ozel-vno7_cover.jpg" alt="Yeni Parti&#039;nin Grup Başkan Vekilleri, PM ve YDK üyeleri belli oldu" width="1280" height="720" fetchpriority="high" />

                                    </figure>
            
            
            <div class="adpro desktop-ad text-center" data-bik-reklam="true" data-bik-reklam-id="ad019ef8f40895709294c70dd4fcc6f69c" data-page="019ef8f4-08cd-73a7-a51f-8515581a9b49" data-region="019ef8f4-0895-7092-94c7-0dd4fcc6f69c" data-category="5fa6ea2f1913fb1ae0497ab7"  ></div>

            <div class="content-text" property="articleBody">
                <p>Ankara'daki Anadolu Kul&uuml;b&uuml;'nde&nbsp;ger&ccedil;ekle&#351;tirilen ve &Ouml;zel dahil 91&nbsp;milletvekilinden olu&#351;an&nbsp;YEN&#304; Parti Kurucular&nbsp;Kurulu'nun ilk toplant&#305;s&#305;nda&nbsp;yap&#305;lan oylamada, &Ouml;zg&uuml;r &Ouml;zel oy&nbsp;birli&#287;iyle genel ba&#351;kanl&#305;&#287;a&nbsp;se&ccedil;ildi.</p>
<p>Kurucular Kurulu toplant&#305;s&#305;n&#305;n ard&#305;ndan ger&ccedil;ekle&#351;tirilen YEN&#304; Parti Kapal&#305; Grup Toplant&#305;s&#305;'nda ise TBMM Grup Ba&#351;kanvekilleri belirlendi. Yap&#305;lan se&ccedil;im sonucunda Ali Mahir Ba&#351;ar&#305;r, Murat Emir ve G&ouml;khan G&uuml;nayd&#305;n grup ba&#351;kanvekilli&#287;i g&ouml;revine se&ccedil;ildi.</p>
<h3>Yeni&nbsp;Parti&nbsp;PM ve YDK &uuml;yeleri belli oldu</h3>
<div class="adpro desktop-ad text-center square" data-bik-reklam="true" data-bik-reklam-id="ad019ef8f4087b7183afcdbb57a2e00b27n2" data-page="019ef8f4-08cd-73a7-a51f-8515581a9b49" data-region="019ef8f4-087b-7183-afcd-bb57a2e00b27" data-category="5fa6ea2f1913fb1ae0497ab7"  data-refresh="60"></div>
<p>Yeni&nbsp;Parti&nbsp;Kurucular Kurulu toplant&#305;s&#305;nda se&ccedil;ilen&nbsp;Parti&nbsp;Meclisi &uuml;yeleri &#351;&ouml;yle:</p>
<p>Ahmet Tuncay &Ouml;zkan, Ahmet Vehbi Bak&#305;rl&#305;o&#287;lu, Ali G&ouml;k&ccedil;ek, Aliye Timisi Ersever, Aliye Co&#351;ar, Asu Kaya, A&#351;k&#305;n Gen&ccedil;, Ay&ccedil;a Ta&#351;kent, Ayhan Barut, Aykut Kaya, Aylin Yaman, Ay&#351;e Sibel Yan&#305;k&ouml;mero&#287;lu, Bar&#305;&#351; Karadeniz, Bekir Ba&#351;evirgen, Bilal Bilici, B&uuml;lent Tezcan, Cavit Ar&#305;, Cemal Enginyurt, Cumhur Uzun, Deniz Yavuzy&#305;lmaz, Deniz Y&uuml;cel, Do&#287;an Demir, Ednan Arslan, Elvan I&#351;&#305;k Gezmi&#351;, Ensar Aytekin, Evrim Karakoz, Evrim R&#305;zvano&#287;lu Emir, Eylem Ertu&#287; Ertu&#287;rul, Fahri &Ouml;zkan, Fethi A&ccedil;&#305;kel, Gamze Ta&#351;c&#305;er, Gizem &Ouml;zcan, G&ouml;k&ccedil;e G&ouml;k&ccedil;en, Hasan &Ouml;zt&uuml;rk, Hikmet Yal&#305;m Hal&#305;c&#305;, &#304;brahim Arslan, &#304;smail Atakan &Uuml;nver, &#304;smet G&uuml;ne&#351;han, &#304;zzet Akbulut, Kay&#305;han Pala, Mahmut Tanal, Mehmet Tahtas&#305;z, Mehmet Salih Uzun, Melih Meri&ccedil;, Metin &#304;lhan, Murat Bakan, Murat &Ccedil;an, Mustafa Erdem, Mustafa Sar&#305;g&uuml;l, Mustafa Sezgin Tanr&#305;kulu, M&uuml;hip Kanko, Nail &Ccedil;iler, Nam&#305;k Tan, Nurhayat Altaca Kay&#305;&#351;o&#287;lu, Okan Konuralp, Orhan S&uuml;mer, &Ouml;zg&uuml;r Ceylan, G&ouml;kan Zeybek, &Ouml;zg&uuml;r Erdem &#304;ncesu, Re&#351;at Karag&ouml;z, Servet Mullao&#287;lu, Seyit Torun, Sibel Sui&ccedil;mez, Suat &Ouml;z&ccedil;a&#287;da&#351;, S&uuml;leyman B&uuml;lb&uuml;l, S&uuml;reyya &Ouml;ne&#351; Derici, &#350;eref Arpac&#305;, Tahsin Ocakl&#305;, Talat Din&ccedil;er, Talih &Ouml;zcan, T&uuml;rkan El&ccedil;i, U&#287;ur Bayraktutan, Ula&#351; Karasu, Utku &Ccedil;ak&#305;r&ouml;zer, &Uuml;mit &Ouml;zlale, Ya&#351;ar T&uuml;z&uuml;n, Yunus Emre, Y&uuml;ksel Ta&#351;k&#305;n, Zeynel Emre ve Seda Kaya &Ouml;sen.</p>
<h3>YDK &uuml;yeleri ise &#351;u isimlerden olu&#351;uyor:</h3>
<p>Ahmet Tuna Soydemir, Ali G&uuml;venba&#351;, Buse Batyar, B&uuml;lent Y&uuml;cet&uuml;rk, Deniz Orhon, Emin An&#305;l Ko&ccedil;, Emresan Dalveren, Ezgi Rahime Ta&#351;demir, G&uuml;lsemin Kaya, I&#351;&#305;l Name Evgin, Kubilay Cem Baran F&#305;rat, Mehmet Hadimi Yakupo&#287;lu, Mete Do&#287;ukan Beyaz, Ural Baysal ve Ziya G&ouml;kalp Koca.</p>
            </div>

